       "source": "ANSA Top News",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "ECB President Christine Lagarde has warned that France needs a credible plan to rein in its debt, adding to pressure around the country’s fiscal outlook.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "19fd4ad54823100b",
       "title": "ECB’s Lagarde warns France needs a credible path to rein in debt - Mitrade",
